  "headline": "UN records approximately 280 Israeli incursion-related incidents in Syria during September",
  "pages": [
    {
      "text": "The United Nations human rights office reported that around 280 incidents involving armed Israeli incursions into Syria were recorded during September. According to the Office of the UN High Commissioner for Human Rights, this represents the highest monthly figure since the beginning of 2026. The UN stated that these figures were based on open-source monitoring."
    }
  ]
